{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-02-23 08:01:00', 'title': "VALENTINE DISTILLING CO. BUILDS ON SUSTAINABILITY COMMITMENT WITH DTE ENERGY'S MIGREENPOWER PROGRAM", 'text': "DETROIT, FEB. 23, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DETROIT, FEB. 23, 2021\xa0– DTE ENERGY AND\xa0VALENTINE DISTILLING CO., ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST CRAFT DISTILLERIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S ENROLLMENT IN DTE'S MIGREENPOWER PROGRAM. MIGREENPOWER IS A VOLUNTARY RENEWABLE ENERGY PROGRAM THAT ENABLES DTE ELECTRIC CUSTOMERS TO REDUCE THEIR CARBON FOOTPRINT BY MATCHING THEIR ENERGY USE TO THE COMPANY'S WIND AND SOLAR PROJECTS. BUILDING ON VALENTINE DISTILLING CO.'S 10-YEAR, $500,000 SUSTAINABILITY INITIATIVE, THE DISTILLERY'S MIGREENPOWER CLEAN ENERGY COMMITMENT WILL OFFSET 9.3 TONS OF CO2, WHICH IS EQUIVALENT TO THE GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS FROM DRIVING NEARLY 21,000 MILES.*"}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-02-23 08:01:00', 'title': "VALENTINE DISTILLING CO. BUILDS ON SUSTAINABILITY COMMITMENT WITH DTE ENERGY'S MIGREENPOWER PROGRAM", 'text': "DETROIT, FEB. 23, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DETROIT, FEB. 23, 2021\xa0– DTE ENERGY AND\xa0VALENTINE DISTILLING CO., ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST CRAFT DISTILLERIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S ENROLLMENT IN DTE'S MIGREENPOWER PROGRAM. MIGREENPOWER IS A VOLUNTARY RENEWABLE ENERGY PROGRAM THAT ENABLES DTE ELECTRIC CUSTOMERS TO REDUCE THEIR CARBON FOOTPRINT BY MATCHING THEIR ENERGY USE TO THE COMPANY'S WIND AND SOLAR PROJECTS. BUILDING ON VALENTINE DISTILLING CO.'S 10-YEAR, $500,000 SUSTAINABILITY INITIATIVE, THE DISTILLERY'S MIGREENPOWER CLEAN ENERGY COMMITMENT WILL OFFSET 9.3 TONS OF CO2, WHICH IS EQUIVALENT TO THE GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS FROM DRIVING NEARLY 21,000 MILES.*"}{'symbol': 'DTE', 'date': '2021-02-23 08:01:00', 'title': "VALENTINE DISTILLING CO. BUILDS ON SUSTAINABILITY COMMITMENT WITH DTE ENERGY'S MIGREENPOWER PROGRAM", 'text': "DETROIT, FEB. 23, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DETROIT, FEB. 23, 2021\xa0– DTE ENERGY AND\xa0VALENTINE DISTILLING CO., ONE OF TH